2127
00:03:57,547 --> 00:04:00,057
<i>Despite everything, PROXIES...</i>

2128
00:04:00,507 --> 00:04:02,387
<i>Their mystery remains unsolved.</i>

2129
00:04:02,387 --> 00:04:06,517
<i>Not only unsolved, it deepens... </i><i>Nothing makes sense anymore.</i>

2130
00:04:07,097 --> 00:04:09,357
<i>To what extent are we being deceived?</i>

2131
00:04:10,687 --> 00:04:14,947
<i>And the greatest mystery of all</i>

2132
00:04:15,647 --> 00:04:17,277
<i>is the one right in front of me.</i>

2133
00:04:18,697 --> 00:04:22,657
meditation   dead calm

2134
00:04:18,697 --> 00:04:22,657
meditation   dead calm

2135
00:04:33,087 --> 00:04:34,967
Good morning.

2136
00:04:52,517 --> 00:04:55,897
<i>Observed PROXY behavior all day.</i>

2137
00:05:16,877 --> 00:05:18,127
<i>Lameness.</i>

2138
00:05:19,427 --> 00:05:24,507
<i>Is leaving the toilet seat up the
 only way you can show your manliness?</i>

2139
00:05:25,267 --> 00:05:26,137
Vincent!

2140
00:05:27,727 --> 00:05:29,137
How many times do I have to tell you?

2141
00:05:29,437 --> 00:05:32,517
Weren't you listening when I told you to put the seat back down?!

2142
00:05:33,107 --> 00:05:33,817
I was-

2143
00:05:33,817 --> 00:05:34,897
No, you weren't!

2144
00:05:38,737 --> 00:05:42,317
<i>Due to boredom, attempted observation of infected autoreiv.</i>

2145
00:06:02,427 --> 00:06:03,797
I see.

2146
00:06:13,977 --> 00:06:16,477
<i>Journeys are often likened to one's life.</i>

2147
00:06:16,767 --> 00:06:18,437
A pinch of salt?

2148
00:06:18,987 --> 00:06:21,027
What a vague instruction.

2149
00:06:21,487 --> 00:06:24,487
<i>A new discovery in this unknown...</i>

2150
00:06:29,157 --> 00:06:30,957
<i>At times, I am surprised...</i>

2151
00:06:32,537 --> 00:06:33,747
Dammit!

2152
00:06:36,917 --> 00:06:37,837
No way!

2153
00:06:38,417 --> 00:06:39,627
What is this?!

2154
00:06:41,797 --> 00:06:43,127
<i>Lunch meal preparation.</i>

2155
00:06:43,507 --> 00:06:46,507
<i>Examined new facet of the cogito virus.</i>

2156
00:06:47,807 --> 00:06:49,637
Are you left-handed as well?

2157
00:06:49,637 --> 00:06:51,387
Left-handed?

2158
00:07:06,117 --> 00:07:09,327
<i>Autoreivs are designed to be ambidextrous.</i>

2159
00:07:09,327 --> 00:07:14,167
<i>Is being left-handed despite that a psychosomatic effect?</i>

2160
00:07:14,917 --> 00:07:16,417
Is it good, Lady?

2161
00:07:17,167 --> 00:07:18,377
It's hard.

2162
00:07:23,217 --> 00:07:27,677
<i>Any conclusion regarding the
 autoreiv's arm dexterity will have to wait.</i>

2163
00:07:28,887 --> 00:07:30,807
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

2164
00:07:30,807 --> 00:07:32,727
<i>I know nothing about PROXIES</i>

2165
00:07:33,057 --> 00:07:36,727
<i>nor about Vincent Law.</i>

2166
00:07:40,647 --> 00:07:41,687
What?

2167
00:07:42,317 --> 00:07:44,487
Oh, don't mind me.

2168
00:07:46,987 --> 00:07:48,157
Found it.

2169
00:08:04,967 --> 00:08:06,717
You have a hole.

2170
00:08:10,137 --> 00:08:12,007
Oh, don't mind it.

2171
00:08:14,347 --> 00:08:17,017
<i>Whether there's a need to know...</i>

2172
00:08:17,017 --> 00:08:18,767
<i>That is the question.</i>

2173
00:08:29,277 --> 00:08:30,157
<i>PM.</i>

2174
00:08:30,157 --> 00:08:33,027
<i>The feared supply shortage issue surfaced suddenly.</i>

2175
00:08:33,027 --> 00:08:36,197
3, 2, 1.

2176
00:08:36,197 --> 00:08:38,787
Miss Re-l, it's been three minutes.

2177
00:08:39,537 --> 00:08:41,247
I haven't washed my hair yet.

2178
00:08:41,537 --> 00:08:44,667
But if you consider the remaining water supply...

2179
00:08:44,667 --> 00:08:47,167
I want to wash my hair today, no matter what!

2180
00:08:47,167 --> 00:08:48,507
Miss Re-l!

2181
00:08:48,507 --> 00:08:49,717
Two more minutes!

2182
00:08:49,717 --> 00:08:52,467
You have short hair, so you only need one minute, right?

2183
00:08:52,467 --> 00:08:54,007
But that's...

2184
00:08:54,847 --> 00:08:59,017
<i>Temporary solution to the water
 supply issue achieved after negotiations.</i>

2185
00:09:11,567 --> 00:09:13,117
What's wrong?

2186
00:09:15,367 --> 00:09:17,037
I'm training my eyeballs.

2187
00:09:30,047 --> 00:09:31,257
<i>AM.</i>

2188
00:09:31,257 --> 00:09:34,347
<i>Significant decrease in morale among crew members.</i>

2189
00:09:35,297 --> 00:09:37,517
It's been three hours already.

2190
00:09:47,527 --> 00:09:49,737
What in the world are they doing?

2191
00:09:52,107 --> 00:09:55,277
The food shortage is only getting worse.

2192
00:09:59,787 --> 00:10:02,617
Are you thinking, "Not beans again"?

2193
00:10:02,617 --> 00:10:05,167
Well, yes...

2194
00:10:05,627 --> 00:10:07,247
but the way you arranged them...

2195
00:10:07,797 --> 00:10:10,917
I thought it might be a good idea to make it look different.

2196
00:10:16,387 --> 00:10:19,677
<i>I am extremely skeptical of such behavior,</i>

2197
00:10:20,097 --> 00:10:24,267
<i>not to mention, just looking at his
 placid face somehow irritates me.</i>

2198
00:10:40,037 --> 00:10:41,037
<i>PM.</i>

2199
00:10:43,787 --> 00:10:45,207
<i>No change.</i>

2200
00:11:28,627 --> 00:11:30,087
New socks...

2201
00:11:32,417 --> 00:11:34,087
How idiotic.

2202
00:11:56,147 --> 00:11:57,447
<i>What's this?</i>

2203
00:11:58,817 --> 00:12:01,657
<i>When traveling under such circumstances,</i>

2204
00:12:01,657 --> 00:12:04,447
<i>there are moments when certain insurmountable barriers</i>

2205
00:12:04,447 --> 00:12:09,457
<i>become tangible truths - barriers between humans and PROXIES,</i>

2206
00:12:10,327 --> 00:12:14,587
<i>between man and cogito-infected autoreiv,</i>

2207
00:12:15,047 --> 00:12:17,837
<i>that prevent them from achieving true coexistence</i>

2208
00:12:19,047 --> 00:12:22,467
<i>and separate their existences from one another.</i>

2209
00:12:31,727 --> 00:12:33,357
Incomprehensible.

2210
00:12:43,527 --> 00:12:44,527
Huh?

2211
00:12:45,237 --> 00:12:46,737
Look, look!

2212
00:12:47,617 --> 00:12:49,867
Not again... She'll get mad at you.

2213
00:12:50,917 --> 00:12:53,167
I'll draw on your face too, Vince.

2214
00:12:53,167 --> 00:12:54,627
Stop that!

2215
00:12:55,127 --> 00:12:56,247
Look, look!

2216
00:12:56,247 --> 00:12:58,047
Stop that...

2217
00:12:59,507 --> 00:13:01,257
But if you're going to do it anyway,

2218
00:13:01,547 --> 00:13:03,087
how about a little more...

2219
00:13:04,047 --> 00:13:05,257
Oh, it's Re-l.

2220
00:13:08,057 --> 00:13:09,767
Look, look at Vince!

2221
00:13:16,437 --> 00:13:17,937
You look like you're enjoying yourself.

2222
00:13:17,937 --> 00:13:19,147
Um...

2223
00:13:21,197 --> 00:13:22,947
I'm sorry!

2224
00:13:23,407 --> 00:13:24,777
Miss Re-l!

2225
00:13:31,907 --> 00:13:33,287
<i>I suddenly realize that,</i>

2226
00:13:33,827 --> 00:13:36,707
<i>faced with an endless horizon,</i>

2227
00:13:36,707 --> 00:13:40,967
<i>we are unbelievably fragile and powerless.</i>

2228
00:13:46,597 --> 00:13:49,007
What do you think about this situation?

2229
00:13:49,007 --> 00:13:51,347
Have you thought of a solution?

2230
00:13:51,347 --> 00:13:53,937
A "solution", you say...

2231
00:13:53,937 --> 00:13:57,107
but if there is no wind, we can't do anything, so...

2232
00:13:57,647 --> 00:13:58,517
"So"?

2233
00:13:58,977 --> 00:14:00,817
So, well...

2234
00:14:00,817 --> 00:14:02,357
"Well" what?

2235
00:14:02,357 --> 00:14:04,607
No, it's nothing.

2236
00:14:04,607 --> 00:14:06,657
What do you mean, "It's nothing"?

2237
00:14:06,657 --> 00:14:09,077
You've come up with <i>nothing</i> after thinking long and hard?

2238
00:14:09,077 --> 00:14:11,827
Or is it that you haven't even tried?

2239
00:14:12,157 --> 00:14:17,377
Who gave you the authority to put dressing on shared food items?

2240
00:14:17,377 --> 00:14:21,087
Why do I have to go along with <i>your</i> preferences?

2241
00:14:21,087 --> 00:14:22,547
Um, well...

2242
00:14:22,547 --> 00:14:25,177
If you have something to say, say it loud and clear.

2243
00:14:25,177 --> 00:14:27,757
I don't feel you have any initiative.

2244
00:14:27,757 --> 00:14:29,347
Same goes for this journey.

2245
00:14:29,807 --> 00:14:31,347
It's all by the seat of your pants!

2246
00:14:31,847 --> 00:14:34,097
Do you have any sense of purpose?

2247
00:14:34,097 --> 00:14:36,687
Th-That'll become clear once I reach Mosk...

2248
00:14:36,687 --> 00:14:37,347
I'm sure...

2249
00:14:39,357 --> 00:14:40,687
I'm sorry.

2250
00:14:40,687 --> 00:14:42,687
Self-deprecation isn't the answer.

2251
00:14:42,687 --> 00:14:43,897
I'm sorr...

2252
00:14:45,737 --> 00:14:48,277
Why are you so wishy-washy?

2253
00:14:48,277 --> 00:14:51,787
Stop making that "what's this woman bitching about?" face.

2254
00:14:51,787 --> 00:14:53,077
You're ruining my appetite!

2255
00:14:53,077 --> 00:14:54,287
Well, um...

2256
00:14:54,287 --> 00:14:58,287
Personally, I think the wind will eventually
 start back up again if we just sit back and wait...

2257
00:14:59,497 --> 00:15:01,457
Why did you just change subjects?

2258
00:15:01,457 --> 00:15:03,127
Right now, we're talking about your...

2259
00:15:04,087 --> 00:15:05,337
Forget it.

2260
00:15:09,297 --> 00:15:10,757
<i>Still bored.</i>

2261
00:15:11,637 --> 00:15:14,057
<i>Observed autoreiv to pass the time.</i>

2262
00:15:18,347 --> 00:15:19,347
No way!

2263
00:15:19,347 --> 00:15:20,557
What's this?!

2264
00:15:22,067 --> 00:15:25,067
Stop making that "what's this woman bitching about?" face.

2265
00:15:25,067 --> 00:15:26,437
You're ruining my appetite!

2266
00:15:31,617 --> 00:15:33,827
<i>Chronic lassitude,</i>

2267
00:15:33,827 --> 00:15:35,747
<i>decline in ability to think...</i>

2268
00:15:41,627 --> 00:15:43,837
<i>I can only see problems.</i>

2269
00:15:46,047 --> 00:15:47,377
Miss Re-l?

2270
00:15:50,717 --> 00:15:53,387
<i>At times, I've tried to understand.</i>

2271
00:16:00,307 --> 00:16:01,937
<i>But, it was futile.</i>

2272
00:16:02,977 --> 00:16:04,687
<i>Snow fell before dawn.</i>

2273
00:16:04,687 --> 00:16:07,107
<i>Navigation distance remains unchanged.</i>

2274
00:16:09,317 --> 00:16:11,157
<i>Woke up at the same time as usual.</i>

2275
00:16:21,417 --> 00:16:23,127
<i>Confirmed situation.</i>

2276
00:16:23,827 --> 00:16:25,797
<i>Lull persists.</i>

2277
00:16:35,597 --> 00:16:38,597
<i>On days that chill you to the bone, your mind wakes up,</i>

2278
00:16:38,597 --> 00:16:41,187
<i>but your body resists.</i>

2279
00:16:41,847 --> 00:16:43,437
God, it's freezing!

2280
00:16:43,437 --> 00:16:45,057
It's snow!

2281
00:16:45,807 --> 00:16:46,897
Re-l!

2282
00:16:46,897 --> 00:16:48,317
Snow! It's snow!

2283
00:16:48,317 --> 00:16:49,897
Let's go play together!

2284
00:16:50,857 --> 00:16:52,067
Re-l!

2285
00:16:52,737 --> 00:16:53,987
C'mon.

2286
00:16:55,197 --> 00:16:56,697
C'moooon...

2287
00:16:56,697 --> 00:16:57,657
Pino!

2288
00:16:57,657 --> 00:16:59,657
Look, it's the aurora!

2289
00:16:59,657 --> 00:17:01,407
What's that?

2290
00:17:03,867 --> 00:17:06,787
Wow! So pretty!

2291
00:17:21,847 --> 00:17:23,687
Stupid!

2292
00:17:22,937 --> 00:17:24,347
Stupid!

2293
00:17:24,137 --> 00:17:25,477
Stupid!

2294
00:17:24,767 --> 00:17:26,097
Stupid!

2295
00:17:26,727 --> 00:17:29,477
Stupid wind!

2296
00:17:28,937 --> 00:17:29,937
...wind!

2297
00:17:29,477 --> 00:17:30,727
...wind!

2298
00:17:30,727 --> 00:17:33,357
Come get me!

2299
00:17:32,777 --> 00:17:34,107
...me!

2300
00:17:33,357 --> 00:17:34,907
...me!

