00:17:36,407 --> 00:17:37,867
What is he doing?

2303
00:17:38,487 --> 00:17:40,907
I'm your foe!

2304
00:17:40,327 --> 00:17:41,447
I'm your foe!

2305
00:17:40,907 --> 00:17:42,327
...your foe!

2306
00:17:41,867 --> 00:17:43,157
...your foe!

2307
00:17:47,247 --> 00:17:48,417
I don't get it.

2308
00:17:48,997 --> 00:17:50,707
Dammit! Damn you!

2309
00:17:51,417 --> 00:17:54,217
Damn you, you bastard!

2310
00:17:55,967 --> 00:17:57,257
There!

2311
00:17:57,257 --> 00:17:58,547
There!

2312
00:18:00,927 --> 00:18:01,887
Damn you!

2313
00:18:03,767 --> 00:18:07,347
<i>Drastically limiting use of electricity for the foreseeable future.</i>

2314
00:18:15,697 --> 00:18:17,607
<i>She's totally staring at me.</i>

2315
00:18:20,487 --> 00:18:22,407
<i>She's saying something too.</i>

2316
00:18:22,407 --> 00:18:23,577
<i>I wonder what she's saying.</i>

2317
00:18:24,697 --> 00:18:25,867
There...

2318
00:18:26,537 --> 00:18:27,537
There...

2319
00:18:27,917 --> 00:18:29,917
<i>Could Miss Re-l be...</i>

2320
00:18:32,457 --> 00:18:33,797
<i>No way.</i>

2321
00:18:38,177 --> 00:18:42,507
<i>I feel cornered - possibly a sign of malnutrition.</i>

2322
00:18:43,057 --> 00:18:45,307
<i>The tension only increases.</i>

2323
00:18:45,597 --> 00:18:46,887
<i>Am I at my limit?</i>

2324
00:19:30,017 --> 00:19:32,307
<i>Slept deeply for the first time in a while.</i>

2325
00:19:32,977 --> 00:19:34,817
<i>Dreamt of Iggy.</i>

2326
00:20:13,397 --> 00:20:15,517
<i>Can only rely on my spirit.</i>

2327
00:20:15,517 --> 00:20:17,977
Vincent, the candle.

2328
00:20:17,977 --> 00:20:19,437
Oh, okay.

2329
