00:22:03,337 --> 00:22:05,417
I'm your foe!

2347
00:22:04,377 --> 00:22:06,217
I'm your foe!

2348
00:22:05,717 --> 00:22:06,967
...your foe!

2349
00:22:11,637 --> 00:22:13,347
It really clears your head, doesn't it.

2350
00:22:20,477 --> 00:22:23,227
Vince, you just went "thud"!

2351
00:22:24,277 --> 00:22:25,607
Don't laugh!

2352
00:22:25,607 --> 00:22:27,987
Come get me!

2353
00:22:29,107 --> 00:22:32,947
<i>Maybe the solution is unexpectedly simple.</i>

2354
00:22:31,317 --> 00:22:32,197
Take that!

2355
00:22:33,447 --> 00:22:34,787
You got me!

2356
00:22:33,907 --> 00:22:36,037
<i>Thinking about it is useless.</i>

2357
00:22:36,037 --> 00:22:38,077
<i>I decided to adopt that mindset.</i>

2358
00:22:39,247 --> 00:22:42,537
<i>Besides, for some reason, right now I feel...</i>

2359
00:23:10,947 --> 00:23:12,277
Pino!

2360
